    "summary": "If your Army Faction is Leagues of Votann, your units have Hostile Acquisition at the start of the battle and whenever you have fewer than 7 Yield Points at the end of your Command phase (+1 to Hit against enemy units within range of an objective marker; re-roll Advance and Charge rolls), or Fortify Takeover with 7 or more (+1 to Hit while this unit is within range of an objective you control; non-Vehicle units give -1 to Wound against attacks whose Strength exceeds their Toughness). You gain 1 YP at the end of each Command phase for holding an objective in your deployment zone, and from round 2 one more for each of: holding one objective outside it, two outside it, and more objectives than your opponent.",
